│ patch_name               │ annealing_insertion_search                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the greedy+full-insertion local search with a multi-strategy search: (1) greedy   │
│                          │ construction with a decaying exploration rate (0.95 → 0.7) to build diverse starting      │
│                          │ solutions, (2) simulated annealing over insertion/relocation moves with adaptive          │
│                          │ temperature so the search can escape local minima that pure insertion descent gets stuck  │
│                          │ in, and (3) iterative first-improvement descent with restarts from perturbed best         │
│                          │ solutions (basin hopping). Using annealing instead of strict descent lets the search      │
│                          │ traverse worse schedules to reach better basins, which should lower makespan further than │
│                          │ the greedy + insertion local search.                                                      │
