│ patch_description        │ Replace the insertion-only local search with a hybrid insertion+swap neighborhood and     │
│                          │ slower annealing. Insertion and swap moves reach different orderings in one step, so      │
│                          │ combining both neighborhoods escapes local optima that either alone cannot. Slower        │
