                        Patch Metadata - Gen 43/200 - Novelty: 1/3 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/3                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ top3_diverse_pool_then_deep_ils                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ The current code spends its budget on many greedy restarts, each followed by a full local │
│                          │ search. Two problems: (1) per-restart local search wastes budget refining mediocre        │
│                          │ solutions, and (2) greedy restarts converge to near-identical schedules, so the single    │
│                          │ best one often sits in a narrow basin. The fix: run many cheap greedy restarts with NO    │
│                          │ refinement, collect the top-3 solutions that are pairwise positionally diverse (<70%      │
│                          │ overlap), then spend all remaining time on ONE deep iterated local search (perturbation + │
│                          │ insertion/swap descent, with a cost cache) started from the best pooled solution. The     │
│                          │ cache makes repeated cost evaluations of similar prefixes cheap, letting the descent run  │
│                          │ many more improving moves in the same budget, which directly lowers makespan.             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Reasoning step-by-step:                                                                   │
│                          │ 1. Greedy restarts are cheap; sampling many gives a broad view of the solution landscape. │
│                          │ 2. Diversity filtering (pairwise positional overlap < 70%) ensures the refinement starts  │
│                          │ from a robust, non-duplicated basin.                                                      │
│                          │ 3. Concentrating the remaining time on a single deep ILS (perturb -> descend -> accept if │
│                          │ better) yields far more improving moves than shallow per-restart descents, and the        │
│                          │ perturbation escapes local minima of the insertion neighborhood.                          │
│                          │ 4. Cost caching (tuple key) avoids recomputing makespan for sequences seen before, a      │
│                          │ large speedup since insertions repeatedly re-evaluate near-identical prefixes.            │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0150                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/z-ai/glm-5.3                                                                   │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low'}                                                                         │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 26; deleted: 0; modified: 77;                                                      │
